    "preamble": "Nereti Koteswara Rao, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 12 March, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy 1 Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.1430 of 2020 Order: This petition is filed under Section 482 of Cr.P.C seeking quash of Fir in Crime No.60/2020 of Mangalagiri (R) Police Station, Guntur Urban District.",
